Extend confirm dialog to link clicks, and confirm sign-out everywhere

The confirm-dialog JS only ever intercepted <form> submissions, so
data-confirm on a plain <a> (like every "Sign out" link) silently did
nothing -- that's what the user was actually testing when reporting
dialogs "still don't appear". Generalized the dialog to also intercept
clicks on any a[data-confirm], and added a sign-out confirmation across
admin/office/super-admin/student.

